title: 'Fix: TLS entropy read blocking /dev/random on bionic/musl'
updated: 2026-09-30T05:15:06Z
---

Found in k71 on the A7600-H: Mbed TLS reads /dev/random outside glibc, which blocked the owner thread's DRBG seeding on kernel 3.4. Fixed in ccb8077: MBEDTLS_PLATFORM_DEV_RANDOM=/dev/urandom, regression test test_entropy_source. Follow-up k77.
